Package: updater
Version: 0.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: docker-ce-cli | docker.io, ca-certificates, curl
Maintainer: Exocortex
Description: Local update worker for Exocortex head services
 The updater applies signed, immutable service releases on one VPS through
 a root-owned Unix socket and automatically rolls back failed deployments.
